The following coccinelle script was used to make this change:

@@
type T, T2;
expression x;
identifier f,f1;
expression E1,E2,E3,E4;
statement S,S1,S2;
@@
- x = (T)kmalloc(E1,E2)
+ x = kzalloc(E1,E2)
... when != \(f(...,x,...)\|<+...x...+>=E3\)
when != \(while(...) S\|for(...;...;...) S\)
(
if ((x!=NULL)&&...) {
... when != \(f1(...,x,...)\|<+...x...+>=E4\)
when != \(while(...) S1\|for(...;...;...) S1\)
- memset((T2)x,0,E1);
...
} else S2
|
- memset((T2)x,0,E1);
)
@@
